    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Thank You for Reaching Out!"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "We’ve received your request for a free estimate, and the Black Pearl Painters team is excited to assist you with your painting project! One of our friendly team members will be in touch within 24-48 hours to discuss your needs and schedule a consultation."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "In the meantime, feel free to explore our portfolio to see examples of our work or check out our services to learn more about how we can bring your vision to life."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "Have Questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Call us at +1 (234) 567-890 or email us at info@blackpearlpainters.com. We’re here to help!"
    },
